      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8CA18CA1FF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牠是我在帕底亞地區觀光的時候\n捉到的寶可夢喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
